 seized those who had wronged, and they became within their homes [corpses] fallen prone","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":94,"sd":null},{"k":"11:95","t":"As if they had never prospered therein. Then, away with Madyan as Thamūd was taken away.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":95,"sd":null},{"k":"11:96","t":"And We did certainly send Moses with Our signs and a clear authority","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":96,"sd":null},{"k":"11:97","t":"To Pharaoh and his establishment, but they followed the command of Pharaoh, and the command of Pharaoh was not [at all] discerning.","j":12,"h":24,"s":11,"a":97,"sd":null}],"juz":12,"hizb":24,"surahs":[11],"sajdah":false}